#14001
ethereal one~
ethereal Mobile Number One~
There's an Ethereal mob here.~
How are you looking at this?~
ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
100 0 0 1d1+15094 1d1+155
1 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>speech_prog open~
if actorhasobjnum(14001)
  mpforce $n drop citadel
  mptransfer $n 14003
  mpecho $n leaves north.
else
  mpechoat $n You must have the key to move, in here.
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpecho Too late.
mppurge self
~
|
