#14010
ma'ar~
Ma'ar, the evil Lord-Adept~
The current incarnation of Ma'ar, the evil Lord-Adept is here.~
Looking at Ma'ar, he changes.  First, you see his true form, as Ma'ar, then
it changes, and you see the man named Darkness in tayledras, Leatha, who fought
against Vanyel at the end of the time of the Herald-Mages.  Then, he becomes
Mornelithe Falconsbane, who fought against k'Sheyna, in the time of Elspeth 
the first of the new Herald-Mages.  Many more incarnations of him flicker by,
but these scare you most.  You feel the urge to run, and never look back.  Ma'ar
glances at you, and as if reading your thoughts, says, "you have come too far
to continue, I must kill you."  Then Ma'ar attacks, and you sink into darkness...~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_AGGRESSIVE|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND
-1000 S
150 0 BODY_HEAD|BODY_MOUTH|BODY_EYE|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HIP|BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 1500d10+12500 100d1+55
256237 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>fight_prog 40~
cast 'acid blast' 
cast 'fireball' 
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'earthquake'
~
>hitprcnt_prog 50~
cast 'acid blast'
cast 'fireball'
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'heal'
cast 'heal'
cast 'heal'
cast 'energy drain'
~
>act_prog invaders~
mpat 14011 MPECHOAT first ma'ar_command:destroy
~
>death_prog 100~
mpmload 14008
~
|
#14011
sentinel first citadel~
the First Sentinel of the Lost Citadel.~
The First Sentinel of the Lost Citadel guards here.~
The Sentinel is about 20 feet high, and he fades back and forth from the
ethereal plane, it is a wonder you can see him.  His mission is to keep 
intruders from uncovering the magical secrets housed inside the Lost Citadel.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY
