#14001
Entrance to the Lost Citadel.~
Here, the plains begin to turn hilly, and you see a mountain spire in the
distance.  You realize, from a sign hanging here, that you have entered the
fabled, long-forgotten Lost Citadel, the place where Ma'ar, the evil 
Lord-Adept, created his magical constructs.  You feel a sense of dread
as you creep in the direction of the spire.~
140 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_HILLS
DDIR_NORTH
The plains, lie behind you.~
~
0 0 12943
DDIR_SOUTH
A mountain spire hangs above your head south~
~
0 0 14002
E
sign~
*****************************************************************************
*                               ***WARNING***                               *
*                       You have entered the Lost Citadel, I                *
*                       recommend that you enter with at least              *
*                       4-5 people, level 80+.  This is quite               *
*                       a dangerous area, please take this                  *
*                       advice to heart.  Thank you,                        *
*                                       Elspeth the Creator.                *
*****************************************************************************~
E
blliirrbbb~
Note to Chaos or Order.
I would appreciate this room being coded with an exit to Easter Eternal, and
the appropriate exit from the Easter Eternal room be coded as well, so this 
will be the entrance to this area from the rest of the world.  Thanks,
                                Elspeth is Trying(usually very trying).~
S
#14002
Entrance to the Spire.~
You have entered a cave opening in the mountain spire.  At first, it seemed 
to be natural, but then the cave smoothed out, and you realize that this was
hewn from the spire using powerful magic...something informs you that this 
was hewn using blood-magic.~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
Looking out the cave opening, you can see the hills and plains back north.~
~
0 0 14001
DDIR_SOUTH
A door.~
door~
EX_ISDOOR|EX_CLOSED|EX_LOCKED|EX_PICKPROOF 14001 14004
S
#14003
Another cave-room in the spire.~
You are in a cave, with smooth walls, and no apparent exits.  There is a 
sentry of the Citadel here to greet you.  There are statues to the Four
Primary Elements, Fire, Water, Air, and Earth, along the wall.  You can't
quite make out the walls, because of the size of this chamber, but you get
the feeling that there is a door north of you.~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
A door.~
door~
EX_ISDOOR|EX_CLOSED|EX_LOCKED|EX_PICKPROOF 14001 14004
S
#14004
a room in the spire.~
You have entered a smooth, small room, with no exits.  You can clearly see 
the walls, for some sort of light source comes from below, and it also 
provides heat.  It is quite hot in here, and you wonder why...then you glance
down. LAVA!!!!~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_LAVA
S
#14005
Another cave-room in the spire.~
You are in a cave, with smooth walls, and no apparent exits.  There is a 
sentry of the Citadel here to greet you.  You see images flashing in and out
of sight, towards the ends of the room.  You are not sure what you see, but
it is quite odd, and you do not wish to investigate.~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
A door.~
door~
EX_ISDOOR|EX_CLOSED|EX_LOCKED|EX_PICKPROOF 14001 14004
