Another cave-room in the spire.~
You are in a cave, with smooth walls, and no apparent exits.  There is a 
sentry of the Citadel here to greet you.  On the floor, there is much dried
blood.  There is a circle marked off in chalk in the middle of the room.~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
