#14008
Another cave-room in the spire.~
You are in a small cave, with smooth walls, and no exits...IT IS A TRAP!!!
You have walked into the room, and realized that you are trapped.  There are
no exits in any direction, and no way out.  You know that the only way out
is to suicide, and you know you will feel stupid when the people at recall
see you without eq...after all, you're supposed to not die much anymore...~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14009
Entrance to the Tests.~
You have passed the sentinels safely, and now it is time to proceed to the 
Tests of Fire, Water, Earth and Air.  Have a good time, for they are 
extremely hard Tests, especially because you will be split up, for once.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14010
Entrance to the Elemental Inner Citadel.~
You have passed your test, now you must wait for the rest of your group to
pass.  You should feel proud, the Tests are extremely hard to pass, and many
die in them.  This is the Inner Citadel, and you shall now have a chance to
go after Ma'ar, the evil Lord-Adept...if your group has survived their Test.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14011
The First Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.~
You are in the First Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.  South of you, a 
door burns hotly, and to the north you see a waterfall with a keyhole.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14012
The Second Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.~
You are in the Second Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.  South of you, a
waterfall with a keyhole falls, and to the north you see a heavy stone door.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14013
The Third Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.~
You are in the Third Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.  South of you, a
heavy stone door closes shut behind you, and to the north you feel a strong
wind pushing you back.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
S
#14014
The Fourth Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.~
You are in the Fourth Elemental Room of the Inner Citadel.  South of you, a
very strong wind blows you awake, and to the north, you see the entrance to
the Inner Citadel.  Near you, you feel the power of Ma'ar growing angry.~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
Entrance to the Inner Citadel.~
~
0 0 14015
S
#14015
Entrance to the Inner Citadel.~
You have entered the Inner Citadel.  Now, there is nothing to do but go 
forward, and face the wrath of Ma'ar.  You start to have second doubts about
your sanity for going through with this kind of idea...something whispers
into your ear "now is the time to die, my young friend."~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
The Inner Citadel.~
~
0 0 14016
S
#14016
The Inner Citadel.~
You have found the very center of the Inner Citadel.  Now, you shall die, for
you have invaded the sanctum of Ma'ar, the evil Lord-Adept, himself.  You
are either a very vain, or a very foolish person, to think that you could
survive against Ma'ar, himself.  Prepare to die, for Ma'ar is indeed here
as you see, walking in.  He sees you, and seems very angry that you are
here.  All of a sudden, a fireball sparks from his fingers, and heads your
way.  You will not have time to duck...~
140 ROOM_NO_RECALL|ROOM_NO_SAVE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
Chakkor.~
~
0 0 9755
E
blliirrbbb~
This is an exit to Chakkor Recall Room, but I do not wish this to be a 
two-way street, only a way out of Lost Citadel, after the group is done
making it through it.  Thanks, 
                Elspeth is Trying(usually very trying).~
S
#14017
The Mage-Room.~
This is the room where Mages are allowed to go freely within the Citadel.  
There is a servant here (this is for mages, so of course he's ethereal) who
will see to any mage's requests to go where they will.~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_ALTAR_C|ROOM_ALTAR_O SECT_INSIDE
S
#14019
Entrance to the Test of Fire.~
You have entered the Test of Fire.  This is an extremely dangerous Test, and
you will only find Necromancers and Assassins here.  As you are about to 
walk forward, a gusher of fire bursts up in front of your nose and says
"watch your step."  Have a nice day. =)~
140 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
The Test of Fire.~
~
