#14020
Entrance to the Test of Water.~
You have entered the Test of Water.  Therefore, you are a rogue or a monk,
so keep your hands to yourself (out of people's pockets).  You will only find 
Rogues or monks here. I would suggest a boat
(flying's a BAD idea, trust me on that.)  
Have a nice day. =)~
